Bundled terminal compatibility code
----------------------------------
Clio bundles the JavaScript from @earendil-works/pi-tui 0.85.1 with a local
input-policy/search/semantic-edit patch, plus marked and get-east-asian-width.
Their MIT notices are distributed in dist/assets/tui-notices/. The pinned
pi-tui runtime package remains installed for its Darwin and Windows native
helpers; Clio does not modify consumer dependencies during installation.
